# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rendered media and production tooling: never uploaded.
# Trainer decision of 6 Nov 2026 — that whole workstream stays local and is not
# shared on the Internet; distribution goes through the partner package. The
# rules below exist so that an accidental `git add -A` cannot republish it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/docs/tools/tts/

# Derivatives of rendered media: review player, checks, package notice.
**/build/course-site/
**/build/qc.mjs
**/build/README-package.txt

*.wav
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.aac
*.flac
*.ogg

# Partner archives: they carry the rendered media and exceed GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit. Distributed outside the repository.
*.zip

# Video: generated demos and any rendered media.
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.mkv

# Sole exception — the practical-works pack versions its 47 demo extracts, so
# the workbook plays exactly as it was verified. Largest clip 21,275,720 bytes,
# well under GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit; 248,915,344 bytes for all 94 media
# files. The negation is scoped to that one directory, so no other *.mp4
# anywhere in the repository can be staged. The poster stills are .jpg and were
# never excluded. The narrated audio stays out: biometric data, local only.
!Formation-IA-Images-Videos-Marketing/lab/assets/demos/media/*.mp4

# Secrets — the CLI reads them outside the repository, never inside it.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.p12
api-key*
apikey*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Office and system files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.qoder-office-pptx-locks/
~$*
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Working copy of the slide generator; only the deliverable is versioned.
**/build/pptx-work/

# Run logs and local backups.
*.log
*.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IIOE documentation supplied by the partner (Feishu extracts, official slide
# template). Confidential: it stays out of the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/docs/IIOE内容开发说明.md
**/docs/IIOE课程合作研发流程、参考与标准.*
**/docs/课程素材要求与示例.*
**/docs/IIOE_通用录课PPT模板_*.pptx
**/docs/IIOE_Course_Configuration_*.docx
